        <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The signs were complete, but hanging them was still pending." data-hint="Separate I’d finished from I hadn’t hung them yet." data-fix="The signs were complete, but hanging them was still pending."><p class="quiz-question">4. Which result was complete, and which action was pending?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The signs were complete, but hanging them was still pending.">The signs were complete, but hanging them was still pending.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The signs were unfinished, but all were already hanging.">The signs were unfinished, but all were already hanging.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Both actions are present habits.">Both actions are present habits.</button></div></div>
