      </div>
      <div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-quiz>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-quiz>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>Tutor transcript and evidence notes</summary>
      <ol>
        <li><span class="ex">By the time we ARRIVED, they’d already LEFT.</span> Evidence: the departure precedes the arrival.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">They HADN’T tested microphone THREE.</span> Evidence: negative auxiliary and contrastive object stress.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">Had you SEEN the revised plan before the BRIEFing?</span> Evidence: linked <span class="ex">Had you</span> plus experience before a later past event.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">I’d FINISHED the signs, but I hadn’t HUNG them yet.</span> Evidence: one completed result and one expected action still pending.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">By FIVE, I’d repaired TWELVE chairs.</span> Evidence: a completed quantity, not activity duration.</li>
      </ol>
    </details>
  </section>

  <h2>Read one complete event reconstruction</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
