  <h2>Build an earlier statement and question</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="the venue team had moved the tables before Maya arrived" data-hint="Start with the earlier-event subject, place had before moved, and end with the Past Simple reference clause." data-fix="The venue team had moved the tables before Maya arrived." data-success-message="Correct. Had moved marks the earlier event, and Maya arrived supplies the later past reference point.">
