  <h2>Reflect: what is the reference point?</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Explain the decision path</h3>
    <p>Complete these ideas aloud: <span class="ex">My main past reference is...</span> <span class="ex">I look farther back to...</span> <span class="ex">Past Simple is enough when...</span> <span class="ex">Before and after can make Past Perfect optional because...</span> <span class="ex">I choose Past Perfect Continuous when...</span></p>
    <p>Create two accurate versions of one sequence: a chronological version with Past Simple, then a version that mentions the later event first and uses Past Perfect to look back.</p>
